# ZMK config files

- Keep keymap and behavior names consistent with existing layers and comments in `config/*.keymap`.
- When changing splits, Studio, Bluetooth, or display options, align `*.conf` entries and `build.yaml` / shield selection so CI and local builds stay coherent.
- Prefer Zephyr/ZMK Kconfig symbols and devicetree patterns already used in this tree over copy-paste from unrelated boards.
